--[[
    UI Library – Reborn
    Inspired by the original "xsx" design.
    - Fully rewritten with classes
    - No busy‑wait loops, no global pollution
    - Responsive (relative sizing + UIScale)
    - Proper dragging using UserInputService
    - Theme support (customizable colors)
    - All components are self‑contained and clean up after themselves
]]

